<opml version="2.0"><head><title>Fig 4 - Route-dependent governance</title></head><body><outline text="Fig 4 - Route-dependent governance"><outline text="Online node write"><outline text="Hard, baseline, product and active recipe bounds" /><outline text="Conditional approval; binding and applicable grant rechecked" /></outline><outline text="Recipe replacement"><outline text="Hard, baseline and product bounds" /><outline text="Not constrained by prior recipe window" /></outline><outline text="Recipe trial"><outline text="Trial override checked against applicable recipe window" /><outline text="Conditional approval and applicable context revalidation" /></outline><outline text="Common execution"><outline text="Shared controller applies applicable checks" /><outline text="Step, interval and hold-window checks apply to specified sources outside benchmark mode" /><outline text="Partial batch application is possible" /></outline></outline></body></opml>